{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"747915178187817123","content":"**Fae'd Wood** extended table options\n5- You strike with impeccable flourish, alluring nearby enemies. Up to 3 hostile creatures within 30 feet of you must succeed on a wisdom saving throw, DC equal to 8 + your proficiency bonus + your charisma modifier, or become charmed for 10 minutes.\n6- The wrath of the seasons lash out from the weapon. All enemies within 15 feet of you take 1d6 fire damage, 1d6 cold damage, are pushed back 5 feet, and have their speed reduced to zero until your next turn.\n7- The strong force of your strike summons a benevolent nature spirit. The spirit has the statistics of an *Awakened Tree*, except it is a small fae instead of a huge plant. It takes its turn immediately after yours and can be commanded (no action required). It remains for 10 minutes before returning to the feywild.\n8- The frigid clutch of the Unseelie court blesses you. Armor of Agathys is cast on you at second level, and lasts for the next 10 minutes.","created_at":"2021-02-05T07:06:12.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"807145037112410132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
